# Phase 5 input cluster, I11: ask_user_question at fx v0.0.16's cap, one batch
# of 20 questions (28cf53b5 raises the cap from 4 to 20). The panel's counter
# at one and two digits, Left at the first question, Tab past the last back
# to the first, the batch answered by ordinal, the 20 resolutions it leaves,
# and the same resolutions replayed by a resume.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-input-question20-turns.json
wait 4
type ask twenty
key Enter
wait 3
snap q20-panel
key Left
wait 0.4
snap q20-left
key Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab
wait 0.4
snap q20-tab10
key Left
wait 0.4
snap q20-back9
key Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab Tab
wait 0.4
snap q20-tab20
key Tab
wait 0.4
snap q20-wrap
type 1
wait 0.4
snap q20-first
type 2121212121212121212
wait 3
snap q20-answered
snapfull q20-answered
keep
type /quit
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 5
snap resumed
snapfull resumed
type /quit
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
gwlog
